    - target: {fileID: 4435524425506235267, guid: 8bfd9d78d6dff414fbceadccb912c611, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'textLines.Array.data[0]'
      value: This is a sacred weather temple.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4435524425506235267, guid: 8bfd9d78d6dff414fbceadccb912c611, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'textLines.Array.data[1]'
      value: If you face the Chaac monument, you can pray for good weather!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5668456217277715989, guid: 8bfd9d78d6dff414fbceadccb912c611, type: 3}
      propertyPath: textLines.Array.size
      value: 5
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5668456217277715989, guid: 8bfd9d78d6dff414fbceadccb912c611, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'textLines.Array.data[0]'
      value: Living in a place like this... I love it!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5668456217277715989, guid: 8bfd9d78d6dff414fbceadccb912c611, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'textLines.Array.data[1]'
      value: A strange man helped me build my home here.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5668456217277715989, guid: 8bfd9d78d6dff414fbceadccb912c611, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'textLines.Array.data[2]'
      value: He used to live in a dark bat cave which he promised to show me one
        day.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5668456217277715989, guid: 8bfd9d78d6dff414fbceadccb912c611, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'textLines.Array.data[3]'
      value: The people here are centrainly interesting.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5668456217277715989, guid: 8bfd9d78d6dff414fbceadccb912c611, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'textLines.Array.data[4]'
      value: All in all, it's a kind of fantasy, living in this community.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5668456217277715989, guid: 8bfd9d78d6dff414fbceadccb912c611, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'textLines.Array.data[5]'
      value: All in all, it's a kind of fantasy, being here today.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5668456217277715989, guid: 8bfd9d78d6dff414fbceadccb912c611, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'textLines.Array.data[6]'
      value: All in all, it's a kind of fantasy, being here today.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
